  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is a cute ladybug the size of a thumb’s fingernail. Its body is milky white, and from the back it looks like a circle. The head occupies a small area. The rest is a large fat stomach with a bright shiny exoskeleton. Six tiny cream coloured limbs hide under the stomach.",
        "chapters": [
          63
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After a meal of pork it keeps that milky white worm look and does not grow.",
        "chapters": [
          70
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In the aperture the round body spreads its wings and flies in circles. White Boar Gu and Black Boar Gu share a similar look.",
        "chapters": [
          64
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "White Boar Gu and Black Boar Gu are equally well-known rare rank one Gu, with market value above the Liquor worm.",
        "chapters": [
          64
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_liquor_worm"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Either sells for about six hundred primeval stones, often as soon as it appears.",
        "chapters": [
          62
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In Fang Yuan’s aperture the Gu has a round body and milky white look, and it can fly with wings.",
        "chapters": [
          64
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "White boar Gu sits in the same series pattern as black, pink, and other boar Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          230
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It changes the Gu Master’s constitution and raises strength permanently. The boost builds over time, belongs wholly to the body, and remains even if the Gu dies.",
        "chapters": [
          62
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Black and White Boar Gu give strength without needing primeval essence to keep that worth in play, and after one person has used them they can still be given to another.",
        "chapters": [
          96
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_black_and_white_boar_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The White Boar Gu’s own ceiling is one boar’s strength. Once that limit is reached it stops adding more.",
        "chapters": [
          71
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Using another White Boar Gu after that adds nothing; a Black Boar Gu can overlay on White Boar strength instead.",
        "chapters": [
          111
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_black_boar_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "With both, Fang Yuan later fights with the strength of two boars.",
        "chapters": [
          120
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Daily use has a short safe window of about fifteen minutes. Past that the modification turns from numbness into sharp pain, and pressing further can kill.",
        "chapters": [
          70
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He obtains it from the first Earth Treasury flower on the inheritance path,",
        "chapters": [
          63
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "then uses it while hunting and training so he can push the blocking boulder once he has one boar’s strength.",
        "chapters": [
          64
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The activation itself is primeval essence into the Gu, white light through the body, and strength rooted into muscle and skin.",
        "chapters": [
          70
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When he expects clan inspection, he leaves White Boar Gu and Jade Skin Gu in his second secret cave rather than carry them.",
        "chapters": [
          86
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeding": {
    "known": true,
    "food_raw": null,
    "foods": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Its food is pork. Black and White Boar Gu both need about one fully grown pig’s worth of meat every five days.",
        "chapters": [
          64
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan feeds it by hunting mountain boars and letting the Gu eat the meat from the carcass.",
        "chapters": [
          70
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
  "refinement": {
    "recipes": [],
    "used_in_recipes": [],
    "refinement_materials": [],
    "confirmed_evolutions": [],
    "related_variants": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The White Boar Gu is most compatible with the Jade Skin Gu. Together they fuse into rank two White Jade Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          64
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fusion-into-white-jade-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_jade_skin_gu",
          "gu_white_jade_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan succeeds at that fusion; the White Boar Gu itself is gone afterward,",
        "chapters": [
          99
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fusion-into-white-jade-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "but the strength it already gave him stays in his body.",
        "chapters": [
          100
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fusion-into-white-jade-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "White Jade Gu keeps and enhances Jade Skin defense, and drops the White Boar Gu’s strength-gain ability.",
        "chapters": [
          105
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fusion-into-white-jade-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
